  "method": {
    "batch": "Only the unit-total rows with two unit caps, zero floors, a certified active upper total and a weak probability below the FP32 round-to-zero boundary use the closed form and old storage routine. The custom first-order derivative uses the unfloored log probabilities and both mathematically free scores. All other rows run frozen r09, in their original batch shape. Objective is the captured task objective, with no optimizer steps.",
